# 22. Remote AI should never unnecessarily block deterministic work

Bad:

```text
click
↓
LLM
↓
wait
↓
generate candidates
↓
check
```

Canonical:

```text
                click
                  │
          ┌───────┴───────┐
          ▼               ▼
deterministic search    LLM enrich
          │               │
          ▼               │
availability begins       │
          │               │
          └──────┬────────┘
                 ▼
           new candidates
```

The first useful answer can appear before AI even finishes.

This pattern applies broadly:

```text
cached result immediately
deterministic result next
external API result next
AI enrichment last
```

Perceived performance improves drastically.

