# 24. AI responses should stream immediately

Your UI should optimize:

```text
time to first token
```

not just:

```text
total generation time.
```

For user-facing AI:

```text
request
↓
first token
↓
stream
↓
complete
```

Never buffer an entire 2,000-token answer before displaying it unless the response must be validated atomically.

Track:

```text
TTFT
TPOT
ITL
p50
p95
p99
