```text
1. Reduce tool calls
2. Reduce model turns
3. Give high-level tools
4. Give strict schemas
5. Return structured output
6. Batch
7. Cache tool discovery
8. Return only necessary data
9. Provide cursors/resources for bulk data
10. Make errors deterministic
11. Make retries safe/idempotent
12. Expose provenance/confidence
```

