# 36. Your canonical resource should be a benchmark contract, not a stack document

The final shift I would make from what I told you earlier is this:

Don't create:

```text
STACK.md

Use:
Rust
Solid
Cloudflare
Postgres
```

Create:

```text
FRONTIER-PERFORMANCE.md
```

whose first requirement is:

> **No technology is canonical. Performance properties are canonical.**

Then require every coding agent to demonstrate:

```text
browser
-------
bundle size
LCP
INP
CLS
main-thread blocking

API
---
